                    "type": "text",
                    "content": "Here are the strongest budget-conscious options I found:\n\n### Restaurant: Le Baratin\n- **Cuisine:** Authentic French bistro cooking\n- **Rating:** **4.8/5**\n- **Address:** **3 Rue Jouye-Rouve, 75020 Paris, France**\n- **Typical price:** About **\u20ac30 per person**\n- **Reviews highlight:** Cozy atmosphere, excellent homestyle dishes made with fresh market ingredients, and a strong natural-wine selection.\n- **Hours:** Lunch **12:00\u20132:00 PM** and dinner **7:30\u201310:30 PM**, on Tuesdays, Thursdays, Fridays, and Saturdays.\n\n### Hotel: Montmartre Suites\n- **Rating:** **4.7/5**\n- **Address:** **23 Rue Lepic, 75018 Paris, France**\n- **Price range:** Approximately **\u20ac110\u2013\u20ac200 per night**\n- **Reviews highlight:** Luxurious, very clean suites, excellent service, attractive Montmartre views, and a convenient location. Some reviews mention street noise and limited soundproofing.\n\nThis combination offers the best balance of high ratings and price within your **\u20ac500 total budget**. However, the final total depends on how many nights you will stay. Also, I\u2019ll need the **year of your November 15 arrival** to confirm whether Le Baratin will be open that day, since its schedule depends on the weekday."
